# Justification:
#   - Vulnerability in C scanf() function with %mc format specifier
#   - Python application does not use C scanf
#   - Risk: LOW (function not used by application)
# Affected packages: libc6
# References: https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-5450
CVE-2026-5450

