# Justification:
#   - Vulnerability in ungetwc() wide character function
#   - Python application does not use C wide character functions
#   - Risk: LOW (function not used by application)
# Affected packages: libc6
# References: https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-5928
CVE-2026-5928

# CVE-2026-6238: glibc DNS response crash
# Justification:
#   - Vulnerability requires crafted DNS response
#   - Application uses Python's requests library with controlled API endpoints
#   - Risk: LOW (vulnerable code path not exposed to untrusted input)
# Affected packages: libc6, libc-bin
